@JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5122

### Health Check
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/health/database
Accept: application/json

### Categories
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Create a category
POST {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Engine Oil", "description": "Motor oils"}

### Products
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Record opening stock
POST {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stock/1/opening
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 100, "reason": "Initial inventory"}

### Process a checkout
POST {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sales/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}, {"productId": 2, "quantity": 1}], "paymentMethod": "Cash"}

### View all sales
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sales
Accept: application/json

### View a specific sale
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sales/1
Accept: application/json

### Void a sale
POST {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sales/1/void
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Customer cancelled"}

### Low stock products
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/low-stock
Accept: application/json

### Daily sales report (defaults to today Manila date)
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/daily-sales
Accept: application/json

### Daily sales report for a specific date
GET {{JeffoyAutoAndMotorShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/daily-sales?date=2026-10-19
Accept: application/json